  "title": "DynamicMotion Acting Templates [RPG Maker MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "DynamicMotion 演技系テンプレート【RPGツクールMVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "139d0f435f23e4b4d5548b3a8004cff49ca0b2b814e9073733e67b3689fede5b",
      "translation": "DynamicMotion Acting Templates [RPG Maker MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "139d0f435f23e4b4d5548b3a8004cff49ca0b2b814e9073733e67b3689fede5b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "演技系のテンプレートを紹介していきます。サイドビュー用のモーションの実行はこちらです。",
      "sourceHash": "45b2f25de996c9dab1e68a7b4c6ace69f8c84d6183fe6057b677b03dbb35c186",
      "translation": "I will introduce templates for acting motions. For executing motions for side-view battles, see here.",
      "contextHash": "45b2f25de996c9dab1e68a7b4c6ace69f8c84d6183fe6057b677b03dbb35c186"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "攻撃（attack）",
      "sourceHash": "4e30719675801e49ea91a33848f4c1940f7912904c4728bac8fecb4b2cb24183",
      "translation": "Attack (attack)",
      "contextHash": "4e30719675801e49ea91a33848f4c1940f7912904c4728bac8fecb4b2cb24183"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "装備している武器を振ります。",
      "sourceHash": "1d303834374892355fdc7c0323d6d37bb9f179386198ec653b92c5766d907c90",
      "translation": "Swings the equipped weapon.",
      "contextHash": "1d303834374892355fdc7c0323d6d37bb9f179386198ec653b92c5766d907c90"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-001",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:attack/> // 武器振り",
      "sourceHash": "a8304627f0702d55a4fc9699a5fbfbe47148fc255006bd2ecae2a9dac17cd6b9",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:attack/> // Weapon Swing",
      "contextHash": "a8304627f0702d55a4fc9699a5fbfbe47148fc255006bd2ecae2a9dac17cd6b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-002",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Animation/> // アニメーション",
      "sourceHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e",
      "translation": "<D-Animation/> // Animation",
      "contextHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ちなみに<D-Animation/>は省略可能ですが、その場合は武器振り終了後にアニメーションが再生されます。",
      "sourceHash": "0808dde53c105cee245688ac2d209f4b92a7f58b9ccd705dd54bfa443ffb9121",
      "translation": "Incidentally, <D-Animation/> can be omitted, but in that case, the animation will play after the weapon swing ends.",
      "contextHash": "0808dde53c105cee245688ac2d209f4b92a7f58b9ccd705dd54bfa443ffb9121"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "weaponIdを指定すれば、武器の表示も変更可能です。魔法剣など特殊な技の作成などにも。",
      "sourceHash": "222c3608b4ae135738109dda476df7edfabe439eb43626cbd6ef0ee3d7bbaf43",
      "translation": "You can also change the displayed weapon by specifying weaponId. This can be used to create special skills such as magic swords.",
      "contextHash": "222c3608b4ae135738109dda476df7edfabe439eb43626cbd6ef0ee3d7bbaf43"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-003",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:attack> // 武器振り",
      "sourceHash": "56e2b9d704826d6f46eb34bc896a9077d3bdf8575d97e5e2956d0d5077bde378",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:attack> // Weapon Swing",
      "contextHash": "56e2b9d704826d6f46eb34bc896a9077d3bdf8575d97e5e2956d0d5077bde378"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-004",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "weaponId = 2 // id = 2（斧）",
      "sourceHash": "4226f5428eff5f0bd7aab34322868d691104c54613085c61770167099a04359c",
      "translation": "weaponId = 2 // id = 2 (Axe)",
      "contextHash": "4226f5428eff5f0bd7aab34322868d691104c54613085c61770167099a04359c"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-005",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Animation/> // アニメーション",
      "sourceHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e",
      "translation": "<D-Animation/> // Animation",
      "contextHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-003",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "各種モーション（svMotion）ver1.15",
      "sourceHash": "2220f923b8229fdd8cfd66c08f63daafa2b4ed64cd3a7a7a6f09e43ffe0ff43a",
      "translation": "Various Motions (svMotion) ver1.15",
      "contextHash": "2220f923b8229fdd8cfd66c08f63daafa2b4ed64cd3a7a7a6f09e43ffe0ff43a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "各種モーションを実行します。",
      "sourceHash": "619f81d47b0d0c061bcc9988def98192e9c30dbb4d0ca432c300420868eae90c",
      "translation": "Executes various motions.",
      "contextHash": "619f81d47b0d0c061bcc9988def98192e9c30dbb4d0ca432c300420868eae90c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "『sv』の後ろにモーション名をつけることで呼び出せます。",
      "sourceHash": "9969f95323255e061f7642d07d7b810350d8a0101fe855c363604ef1e6d6567f",
      "translation": "You can call them by adding the motion name after “sv”.",
      "contextHash": "9969f95323255e061f7642d07d7b810350d8a0101fe855c363604ef1e6d6567f"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-006",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:svThrust/> // 突き",
      "sourceHash": "46b45ef50da1410088694f24a559bdb9382798925777e9aa9bc9d453f96b6e19",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:svThrust/> // Thrust",
      "contextHash": "46b45ef50da1410088694f24a559bdb9382798925777e9aa9bc9d453f96b6e19"
    },
