    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "具体的にどのようなモーションかを知りたければ、ツクールＭＶ・ＭＺヘルプにある『サイドビューキャラ規格』を参照してください。",
      "sourceHash": "f527c8fd5ca48e14de55a39751d48e11f0b959849e4a07a2bbd5ff9693ba972a",
      "translation": "If you want to know exactly what each motion looks like, refer to “Side-View Character Standards” in the RPG Maker MV & MZ Help.",
      "contextHash": "f527c8fd5ca48e14de55a39751d48e11f0b959849e4a07a2bbd5ff9693ba972a"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-004",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "逆再生（reverse）ver1.15",
      "sourceHash": "1574dcc79432ebfe6f8dda734f2d8ac7bfc175217f59b5e377d34e01a8163a6c",
      "translation": "Reverse Playback (reverse) ver1.15",
      "contextHash": "1574dcc79432ebfe6f8dda734f2d8ac7bfc175217f59b5e377d34e01a8163a6c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "モーションを逆再生します。",
      "sourceHash": "0dafb8627a0cdce65b6b23ed2dd046fa4aa10a37e21c01da1e2dcf42c6cefeee",
      "translation": "Plays the motion in reverse.",
      "contextHash": "0dafb8627a0cdce65b6b23ed2dd046fa4aa10a37e21c01da1e2dcf42c6cefeee"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-008",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:attack&reverse/> // 武器振り（逆）",
      "sourceHash": "3408d0dfd83199c4369964ff9aab6b75a82ae990d2afb9fa14e0866e5c641ec1",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:attack&reverse/> // Weapon Swing (Reverse)",
      "contextHash": "3408d0dfd83199c4369964ff9aab6b75a82ae990d2afb9fa14e0866e5c641ec1"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-009",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Animation/> // アニメーション",
      "sourceHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e",
      "translation": "<D-Animation/> // Animation",
      "contextHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "例えば、剣ならば振り上げるような感じになる……と言いたいところですが、武器のグラフィックが微妙でいまいちパッとしません。",
      "sourceHash": "43f417fb4738dc3b8fc57f07d2fe872b8bed169f3edeec590e26ad1946a6499e",
      "translation": "For example, with a sword, it looks like the character is raising it to swing… or at least that is what I would like to say, but the weapon graphic is not quite right, so the result is underwhelming.",
      "contextHash": "43f417fb4738dc3b8fc57f07d2fe872b8bed169f3edeec590e26ad1946a6499e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "グラフィック次第ではもっといい感じにできるかもしれません。",
      "sourceHash": "b70deb13ac1d6bdcef59a70fc06df87c06e57becc4570be66d43f55510fab8f6",
      "translation": "Depending on the graphic, it might be possible to make it look better.",
      "contextHash": "b70deb13ac1d6bdcef59a70fc06df87c06e57becc4570be66d43f55510fab8f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "attackだけではなく全てのモーションと組み合わせできるため、色々と使い道を模索してみてください。",
      "sourceHash": "8060c402d2e851b4d0a96be63dbb3f593a72a6d2aacc5351665a2eacda6e19a1",
      "translation": "Since it can be combined with all motions, not just attack, try exploring various ways to use it.",
      "contextHash": "8060c402d2e851b4d0a96be63dbb3f593a72a6d2aacc5351665a2eacda6e19a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-005",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "パターン０（pattern0）ver1.15",
      "sourceHash": "1645cb866c3ef7cdb2363cdac413a51135377ef03fa43c3d80723f8fe47de05d",
      "translation": "Pattern 0 (pattern0) ver1.15",
      "contextHash": "1645cb866c3ef7cdb2363cdac413a51135377ef03fa43c3d80723f8fe47de05d"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "パターン１（pattern1）ver1.15",
      "sourceHash": "75e42d46beb2772732bbb7a8869a36100c4fb3cf5f4f28a6948db6648777af15",
      "translation": "Pattern 1 (pattern1) ver1.15",
      "contextHash": "75e42d46beb2772732bbb7a8869a36100c4fb3cf5f4f28a6948db6648777af15"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "パターン２（pattern2）ver1.15",
      "sourceHash": "f32f194e99ad634737b21dfd5968015e27b1a51ce1f7e33ecf31cfbdf38b30de",
      "translation": "Pattern 2 (pattern2) ver1.15",
      "contextHash": "f32f194e99ad634737b21dfd5968015e27b1a51ce1f7e33ecf31cfbdf38b30de"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "それぞれモーションを特定パターンで停止したポーズを取ります。パターンは0→1→2のモーションの順番通りです。",
      "sourceHash": "7b28880f697dfc1b9389c21acc02f2fb253984f66d66e6c80b690304907d9146",
      "translation": "Each one makes the character take a pose with the motion stopped at a specific pattern. The patterns correspond to the motion sequence 0 → 1 → 2.",
      "contextHash": "7b28880f697dfc1b9389c21acc02f2fb253984f66d66e6c80b690304907d9146"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-010",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:attack&pattern2/> // 攻撃パターン2",
      "sourceHash": "9f8c1407516c9889bfdfc73de44c549799ff3ed1e0f58cfbec302c0fd2043dfb",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:attack&pattern2/> // Attack Pattern 2",
      "contextHash": "9f8c1407516c9889bfdfc73de44c549799ff3ed1e0f58cfbec302c0fd2043dfb"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-011",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Animation/> // アニメーション",
      "sourceHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e",
      "translation": "<D-Animation/> // Animation",
      "contextHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "こちらも武器グラフィックの設定と合わせれば、使い道を見出だせるかもしれません。",
      "sourceHash": "2d50cb55dcb6254f178c469ea57cf44bde9b9e103363a6feee50e89de8aa13ee",
      "translation": "When combined with the weapon graphic settings, these might also have some useful applications.",
      "contextHash": "2d50cb55dcb6254f178c469ea57cf44bde9b9e103363a6feee50e89de8aa13ee"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※上記のテンプレートで事足りるため、ここより下のテンプレートは不要になりました。以降は互換性のために残しています。",
      "sourceHash": "77746aa262790f8990df5f3ae004293463e5b693e428d12e778f78eed341639d",
      "translation": "※The templates below are no longer necessary because the templates above are sufficient. They are retained below for compatibility.",
      "contextHash": "77746aa262790f8990df5f3ae004293463e5b693e428d12e778f78eed341639d"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "攻撃R（attackR）",
      "sourceHash": "c724f524fa779b8da9b92f4e6366c0b2de7b020aea8758039d6139a4a9ab7402",
      "translation": "Attack R (attackR)",
      "contextHash": "c724f524fa779b8da9b92f4e6366c0b2de7b020aea8758039d6139a4a9ab7402"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-015",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "攻撃モーションを逆再生します。Rはreverseの略です。",
      "sourceHash": "2644f95e351de13c22c6b2a2204ff8388fd17293667ace24a6364f4cf923fe00",
      "translation": "Plays the attack motion in reverse. The R stands for reverse.",
      "contextHash": "2644f95e351de13c22c6b2a2204ff8388fd17293667ace24a6364f4cf923fe00"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-012",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:attackR/> // 武器振り（逆）",
      "sourceHash": "4704ce940f93a9e1f79ed69c94ae3eb7459a514d9cef53e4396bed7f3d48bb2e",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:attackR/> // Weapon Swing (Reverse)",
      "contextHash": "4704ce940f93a9e1f79ed69c94ae3eb7459a514d9cef53e4396bed7f3d48bb2e"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-013",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Animation/> // アニメーション",
      "sourceHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e",
      "translation": "<D-Animation/> // Animation",
      "contextHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "攻撃0（attack0）",
      "sourceHash": "117a8a5b2c68effef7bce7d2bc6e52923e545a2e894f5acb17e36241485f59a7",
      "translation": "Attack 0 (attack0)",
      "contextHash": "117a8a5b2c68effef7bce7d2bc6e52923e545a2e894f5acb17e36241485f59a7"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "攻撃1（attack1）",
      "sourceHash": "bb56b5a310e04b063d7d3054f750358ee4e7db97f203327fcf930358482eb47c",
      "translation": "Attack 1 (attack1)",
      "contextHash": "bb56b5a310e04b063d7d3054f750358ee4e7db97f203327fcf930358482eb47c"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-011",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "攻撃2（attack2）",
      "sourceHash": "8ad626c0d3c4da1d397a6c1a7859a9ffb715577ec04d33489f781e05ce9c7ebe",
      "translation": "Attack 2 (attack2)",
      "contextHash": "8ad626c0d3c4da1d397a6c1a7859a9ffb715577ec04d33489f781e05ce9c7ebe"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-016",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "それぞれ攻撃モーションを特定パターンで停止したポーズを取ります。パターンは0→1→2のモーションの順番通りです。",
      "sourceHash": "c812a6e7149025510f1d01aebdc693f9c3487fb59d665d794169c461282137cc",
      "translation": "Each one makes the character take a pose with the attack motion stopped at a specific pattern. The patterns correspond to the motion sequence 0 → 1 → 2.",
      "contextHash": "c812a6e7149025510f1d01aebdc693f9c3487fb59d665d794169c461282137cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-014",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:attack2/> // 攻撃パターン2",
      "sourceHash": "4a016e86d3e0906b33904c9a9384586c9b44ba44054c94ff3979d43997d9b55d",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:attack2/> // Attack Pattern 2",
      "contextHash": "4a016e86d3e0906b33904c9a9384586c9b44ba44054c94ff3979d43997d9b55d"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-015",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Animation/> // アニメーション",
      "sourceHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e",
      "translation": "<D-Animation/> // Animation",
      "contextHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-017",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "こちらも武器グラフィックの設定と合わせれば、使い道を見出だせるかもしれません。",
      "sourceHash": "2d50cb55dcb6254f178c469ea57cf44bde9b9e103363a6feee50e89de8aa13ee",
      "translation": "When combined with the weapon graphic settings, these might also have some useful applications.",
      "contextHash": "2d50cb55dcb6254f178c469ea57cf44bde9b9e103363a6feee50e89de8aa13ee"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-012",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "突き（thrust）",
      "sourceHash": "57cafa1591d643f85a19e8770a16a709eb475506b9106f104a2d1a171eb15077",
      "translation": "Thrust (thrust)",
      "contextHash": "57cafa1591d643f85a19e8770a16a709eb475506b9106f104a2d1a171eb15077"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-018",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "突きのモーションを素手で行います。",
      "sourceHash": "b6bafff22ca03bd3e726a1c0e5a6e53812e67bb5567310873c63ddc1b3cc426d",
      "translation": "Performs the thrust motion bare-handed.",
      "contextHash": "b6bafff22ca03bd3e726a1c0e5a6e53812e67bb5567310873c63ddc1b3cc426d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-019",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "そのまんま、素手スキルなんかに使えそうです。",
      "sourceHash": "9259f050f572ce5e40906a6c1073491cd326dd2349c67c4c5cab44a9b5f827f0",
      "translation": "It can be used as-is for bare-handed skills.",
      "contextHash": "9259f050f572ce5e40906a6c1073491cd326dd2349c67c4c5cab44a9b5f827f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-016",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:thrust/> // 突き",
      "sourceHash": "4ad32eac8539bed3e8f7121eb3dd564a27d6411379361f972d69e89506bca317",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:thrust/> // Thrust",
      "contextHash": "4ad32eac8539bed3e8f7121eb3dd564a27d6411379361f972d69e89506bca317"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-017",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Animation/> // アニメーション",
      "sourceHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e",
      "translation": "<D-Animation/> // Animation",
      "contextHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-013",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "振り（swing）",
      "sourceHash": "6a9cc04569cd65c1304b87ba54bcde224171dd9afeab8292c9c79c54c4d1f63d",
      "translation": "Swing (swing)",
      "contextHash": "6a9cc04569cd65c1304b87ba54bcde224171dd9afeab8292c9c79c54c4d1f63d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-020",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "振りのモーションを素手で行います。",
      "sourceHash": "ee72edf1992ce42b8e2dbd78087e07e52facccde1f6be7f8fed8830222383713",
      "translation": "Performs the swing motion bare-handed.",
      "contextHash": "ee72edf1992ce42b8e2dbd78087e07e52facccde1f6be7f8fed8830222383713"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-021",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "投擲技なんかにどうでしょう？",
      "sourceHash": "e511107235f39f434f5499d5f8a87e5cc2d1ee52cac587c30013f7907b41c788",
      "translation": "How about using it for throwing techniques?",
      "contextHash": "e511107235f39f434f5499d5f8a87e5cc2d1ee52cac587c30013f7907b41c788"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-018",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:swing/> // 振り",
      "sourceHash": "4bd6d229d78800199cced36a58b76fdb304badaf5fa0889931141ed02a46a46f",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:swing/> // Swing",
      "contextHash": "4bd6d229d78800199cced36a58b76fdb304badaf5fa0889931141ed02a46a46f"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-019",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Animation:shot/> // アニメーションを飛ばす",
      "sourceHash": "2684506dd11a54a5d33eea4a4ad2e6869815e714b0f9f2a9b5ce718b4355fb32",
      "translation": "<D-Animation:shot/> // Skip Animation",
      "contextHash": "2684506dd11a54a5d33eea4a4ad2e6869815e714b0f9f2a9b5ce718b4355fb32"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-014",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "飛び道具（missile）",
      "sourceHash": "c8aa3b3c59c4d250f5e4ab42c32033453bb62fc176f3b4541da62ac1b430b312",
      "translation": "Projectile (missile)",
      "contextHash": "c8aa3b3c59c4d250f5e4ab42c32033453bb62fc176f3b4541da62ac1b430b312"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-022",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "飛び道具のモーションを素手で行います。",
      "sourceHash": "2f362e37464766033937b09d8cd30042bac518536bdf9b4d65ba65c17ac0564f",
      "translation": "Performs the projectile motion bare-handed.",
      "contextHash": "2f362e37464766033937b09d8cd30042bac518536bdf9b4d65ba65c17ac0564f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-023",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "……う～ん、なんに使えるんでしょうね、これ？",
      "sourceHash": "b78c7e44b4a26fbb6429edbd0fb89ca2c4b78527d28534db9010d03de21b3f12",
      "translation": "...Hmm, what could this be used for?",
      "contextHash": "b78c7e44b4a26fbb6429edbd0fb89ca2c4b78527d28534db9010d03de21b3f12"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-024",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "弓などを想定して、左手を前に突き出したモーションになっているようです。ワンツーパンチとか……？ 用途は皆様にお任せします。",
      "sourceHash": "992f7f65e90c6331197c830744b09312dc18d6f6de5e235555a57515564419de",
      "translation": "It seems to be a motion with the left hand thrust forward, intended for use with a bow or something similar. One-two punches, perhaps...? I'll leave the uses up to you.",
      "contextHash": "992f7f65e90c6331197c830744b09312dc18d6f6de5e235555a57515564419de"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-020",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:missile/> // 飛び道具",
      "sourceHash": "a6aa9952c0b9fa38ab8d02c5b932c1429a696a9e0f7997414176646efab8615c",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:missile/> // Projectile",
      "contextHash": "a6aa9952c0b9fa38ab8d02c5b932c1429a696a9e0f7997414176646efab8615c"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-021",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Animation:shot/> // アニメーションを飛ばす",
      "sourceHash": "2684506dd11a54a5d33eea4a4ad2e6869815e714b0f9f2a9b5ce718b4355fb32",
      "translation": "<D-Animation:shot/> // Skip Animation",
      "contextHash": "2684506dd11a54a5d33eea4a4ad2e6869815e714b0f9f2a9b5ce718b4355fb32"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-015",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "魔法（spell）",
      "sourceHash": "a0d6a8fe7682967074451d28599b0dbad68f44b167c3cc5e7e80e23d00c470ea",
      "translation": "Magic (spell)",
      "contextHash": "a0d6a8fe7682967074451d28599b0dbad68f44b167c3cc5e7e80e23d00c470ea"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-025",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "魔法系スキル発動時のモーションを行います。",
      "sourceHash": "d1bb47b3b32fd9e48ba3c0dc6ea283cd9eab0634d4c1bed2db10c8986a65ea42",
      "translation": "Performs the motion used when activating a magic skill.",
      "contextHash": "d1bb47b3b32fd9e48ba3c0dc6ea283cd9eab0634d4c1bed2db10c8986a65ea42"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-026",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "当プラグインでモーション指定時は、発動のモーションを取らなくなります。必要な場合はこれを指定してください。",
      "sourceHash": "a4dea74472af3f813125aa4e64442f0fe56c6f1f4763982b5cfde8722a163e06",
      "translation": "When a motion is specified with this plugin, the activation motion is no longer performed. Specify this when necessary.",
      "contextHash": "a4dea74472af3f813125aa4e64442f0fe56c6f1f4763982b5cfde8722a163e06"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-022",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:spell/> // 魔法モーション",
      "sourceHash": "1894691ed6ce2442b4126029eff586a1cff97cbd822d760f57eeb5e764289fdc",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:spell/> // Magic Motion",
      "contextHash": "1894691ed6ce2442b4126029eff586a1cff97cbd822d760f57eeb5e764289fdc"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-023",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Animation:spell/> // 発動アニメーション",
      "sourceHash": "3031172cea0f8d9ad5baa50f27ed5309f1d793ddf87d989040a6995c41897f1b",
      "translation": "<D-Animation:spell/> // Activation Animation",
      "contextHash": "3031172cea0f8d9ad5baa50f27ed5309f1d793ddf87d989040a6995c41897f1b"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-024",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Animation/> // 攻撃アニメーション",
      "sourceHash": "8e6f29f2b82f469a84c4faf4d0b096036592b932a21e657ae785360133511356",
      "translation": "<D-Animation/> // Attack Animation",
      "contextHash": "8e6f29f2b82f469a84c4faf4d0b096036592b932a21e657ae785360133511356"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-027",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "発動アニメーションとセットにしてみました。見やすいように発動アニメーションのサイズや透明度を調整しています。",
      "sourceHash": "42b9f1ee20319978c72b15d0698392eef005ed3ed294c0fe29d7e1d40dd3c3a3",
      "translation": "I paired it with an activation animation. I adjusted the activation animation's size and opacity to make it easier to see.",
      "contextHash": "42b9f1ee20319978c72b15d0698392eef005ed3ed294c0fe29d7e1d40dd3c3a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-016",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "スキル（skill）",
      "sourceHash": "180ed683f56766b787d26c55a69a857f4104917eb4843dd5e44cb7a7c4a137ac",
      "translation": "Skill (skill)",
      "contextHash": "180ed683f56766b787d26c55a69a857f4104917eb4843dd5e44cb7a7c4a137ac"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-028",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "汎用スキル発動時のモーションを行います。",
      "sourceHash": "4487622c41d35e45af614c9baa6403cba36f7ef1946e872152c9749e3be5163b",
      "translation": "Performs the motion used when activating a general-purpose skill.",
      "contextHash": "4487622c41d35e45af614c9baa6403cba36f7ef1946e872152c9749e3be5163b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-029",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "当プラグインでモーション指定時は、発動のモーションを取らなくなります。必要な場合はこれを指定してください。",
      "sourceHash": "a4dea74472af3f813125aa4e64442f0fe56c6f1f4763982b5cfde8722a163e06",
      "translation": "When a motion is specified with this plugin, the activation motion is no longer performed. Specify this when necessary.",
      "contextHash": "a4dea74472af3f813125aa4e64442f0fe56c6f1f4763982b5cfde8722a163e06"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-025",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:skill/> // スキルモーション",
      "sourceHash": "cfbcdfaadcbed27595b83057dcc7937f0d987f9898b61eb07b926e246f2ed312",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:skill/> // Skill Motion",
      "contextHash": "cfbcdfaadcbed27595b83057dcc7937f0d987f9898b61eb07b926e246f2ed312"
    }
  ],
  "lines": [
