        {
          "source": "のページと若干の重複があります。ただし、こちらでは簡単な説明しかしません。詳細はあちらをご覧ください。",
          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "There is some overlap with the [[LINK_1]]Basic Usage[[/LINK_1]] page. However, only a brief explanation is provided here. See that page for details.",
      "contextHash": "27e1ff80368c7c127d0f83ba281a68efefe46c854eaded4e67a068434a360298"
